{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"hechang-e-28bb4a90b65e0d4222be","title":"韩宣丞相军谋掾与曹植邺中辩礼","accounts":[{"id":"hechang-a-28bb4a90b65e0d4222be","label":"裴注·魏略列传","text":"韩宣丞相军谋掾与曹植邺中辩礼","evidence":["hechang-q-c705b66cb8222766fc1b"]}],"participants":[{"person":"hechang-p-78faf4501d9fc0","role":"任官答辩","evidence":["hechang-q-c705b66cb8222766fc1b"]},{"person":"wudi-p0280","role":"问礼","evidence":["hechang-q-c705b66cb8222766fc1b"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["hechang-q-c705b66cb8222766fc1b"]},"ordering_evidence":"hechang-q-c705b66cb8222766fc1b","order":4872}],"persons":[{"id":"hechang-p-78faf4501d9fc0","name":"韩宣","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0280","name":"曹植","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"hechang-q-c705b66cb8222766fc1b","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-de0d991b673a2dc44b5b","layer":"pei","quote":"建安中，丞相召署军谋掾，冗散在邺。尝于邺出入宫，于东掖门内与临淄侯植相遇。时天新雨，地有泥潦。宣欲避之，阂潦不得去；乃以扇自障，住于道边。植嫌宣既不去，又不为礼；乃驻车，使其常从问宣：‘何官？’宣云：‘丞相军谋掾也。’植又问曰：‘应得唐突列侯否？’宣曰：‘《春秋》之义，王人虽微，列于诸侯之上；未闻宰士而为下土诸侯礼也。’植又曰：‘即如所言，为人父吏，见其子应有礼否？’宣又曰：‘于礼：臣、子一例也；而宣年又长。’植知其枝柱难穷，乃释去；具为太子言，以为辩。","attribution":"裴注·魏略列传","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":386,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-e3d593d747be095d124a","start":17,"end":246,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
